1
00:00:21,402 --> 00:00:24,015
They told us to fear what we carry inside

2
00:00:24,065 --> 00:00:26,618
They built us a cage and they called it a guide

3
00:00:26,668 --> 00:00:29,301
We tore out the bars and we lit them on fire

4
00:00:29,351 --> 00:00:32,024
Now every last demon is singing our choir

5
00:00:32,074 --> 00:00:33,394
Whoa-oh, whoa-oh

6
00:00:35,697 --> 00:00:38,760
Every will is mine to own

7
00:00:42,785 --> 00:00:48,250
You run when I say run, you fall when I say fall

8
00:00:48,751 --> 00:00:53,186
I hold the strings that tie you to the wall

9
00:00:53,236 --> 00:00:55,709
The night bends low to hear me speak

10
00:00:55,759 --> 00:00:58,732
I make the mighty tremble and the faithful weak

11
00:00:58,782 --> 00:01:01,074
Lift your eyes and watch the fire climb

12
00:01:01,124 --> 00:01:05,267
Every heart in this field beats in time with mine

13
00:01:06,250 --> 00:01:08,922
Soul shards on a chain like a crown on the dead

14
00:01:08,972 --> 00:01:11,465
Every one is a trophy, every one we bled

15
00:01:11,515 --> 00:01:14,048
Life tap in the veins and we're stronger for it

16
00:01:14,098 --> 00:01:16,650
Curse of tongues on the priest, now he can't even pray it

17
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:19,322
Whoa-oh, whoa-oh

